// A line after one that always leaves its block never runs.

@var $door_open = false

== kitchen.door
@jump kitchen.leave
The door creaks.
// PIB3001

== kitchen.cellar
@if $door_open
    @end
    Unreachable inside the block.
//  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB3001
@else
    @return
Unreachable after the whole `@if`.
// PIB3001
Only the first one in a block is reported.

// Must not trigger

== kitchen.leave
@if $door_open
    @jump kitchen.door
Without an `@else`, this runs when the condition is false.
-> Stay
    @end
-> Go
    @jump kitchen.door
After a choice, this runs if no option is available.
@if false
    The condition is never evaluated.
